(6382481, 945733, 69487, '<td valign="top">While it is likely that the surface these glasses are seated is tilted the apparent horizon line in the image is not.  I just have a feeling you might get hammered a bit for this.  The effect you were probably going for is apparent and creative and will make patient people stop and think about what is going on here.</td>', 'While it is likely that the surface these glasses are seated is tilted the apparent horizon line in the image is not.  I just have a feeling you might get hammered a bit for this.  The effect you were probably going for is apparent and creative and will make patient people stop and think about what is going on here.', '2011-04-11 06:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
