(6382542, 945306, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing really wrong with this shot as far as technicals or composition. It''s quite well done actually. The problem I see is that it''s just not terribly interesting to me. I think the audience for this shot would be limited to the people work in this field or maybe folks from the area. Voters may have the same disconnect I do. Hopefully they''re not too harsh, because like I said, it''s a good image.</td>', 'There''s nothing really wrong with this shot as far as technicals or composition. It''s quite well done actually. The problem I see is that it''s just not terribly interesting to me. I think the audience for this shot would be limited to the people work in this field or maybe folks from the area. Voters may have the same disconnect I do. Hopefully they''re not too harsh, because like I said, it''s a good image.', '2011-04-11 07:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
