(6382620, 945691, 15711, '<td valign="top">The geometry of the bridge really works at that angle.  I like those kinds of clouds.  The front (lower left) is in color whereas the top (upper right) is almost black and white.  Kind of like you are going to another dimension, as the title indicates.  The more I look at this, the more I like it. 8</td>', 'The geometry of the bridge really works at that angle.  I like those kinds of clouds.  The front (lower left) is in color whereas the top (upper right) is almost black and white.  Kind of like you are going to another dimension, as the title indicates.  The more I look at this, the more I like it. 8', '2011-04-11 09:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382621, 945758, 124982, '<td valign="top">Halfway throug voting on this challenge, and this is the first image that actually appeals to me. Lovely, peaceful image!</td>', 'Halfway throug voting on this challenge, and this is the first image that actually appeals to me. Lovely, peaceful image!', '2011-04-11 09:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
