(6382631, 945789, 15711, '<td valign="top">Every time I see images of the open road, especially at night, I think of that song <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=5h_g5Fmk-ig" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">A Thousand Miles From Nowhere</a>.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Every time I see images of the open road, especially at night, I think of that song A Thousand Miles From Nowhere.  I like this a lot.', '2011-04-11 09:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382633, 945717, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is fab.  It has a sense of a child''s dream.  FUN stuff.</td>', 'Oh this is fab.  It has a sense of a child''s dream.  FUN stuff.', '2011-04-11 09:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382635, 945725, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s wild and totally surreal.  I love that one lens is reflecting the white light and the other one isn''t.  Hope you let that guy out of the sand right after the shoot. LOL This would be cool in a BW conversion too. :)</td>', 'Oh that''s wild and totally surreal.  I love that one lens is reflecting the white light and the other one isn''t.  Hope you let that guy out of the sand right after the shoot. LOL This would be cool in a BW conversion too. :)', '2011-04-11 09:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382636, 944864, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts with a kind of Ansel Adams feel. :)</td>', 'Great contrasts with a kind of Ansel Adams feel. :)', '2011-04-11 09:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382638, 945221, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like how the reds of the kites mimic the barn colors. :)</td>', 'I like how the reds of the kites mimic the barn colors. :)', '2011-04-11 09:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382639, 945306, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting and makes me take a 2nd look. :)</td>', 'This is interesting and makes me take a 2nd look. :)', '2011-04-11 09:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382640, 945572, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is stunning.  Almost like a dream, or the happy ending at the final part of a scary movie.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.</td>', 'Oh this is stunning.  Almost like a dream, or the happy ending at the final part of a scary movie.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.', '2011-04-11 09:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382642, 945721, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is fabulous.  Makes me feel like I''m flying.  My favorite so far. :) 9</td>', 'Oh this is fabulous.  Makes me feel like I''m flying.  My favorite so far. :) 9', '2011-04-11 09:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382643, 944986, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful painterly colors!! Right off of Monet''s palette.</td>', 'Beautiful painterly colors!! Right off of Monet''s palette.', '2011-04-11 09:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382644, 945679, 15711, '<td valign="top">That arching vine really adds to this shot.  I love the sky. I feel like it''s a summer day and I''m lying on my back looking up. I can almost hear the crickets. :)</td>', 'That arching vine really adds to this shot.  I love the sky. I feel like it''s a summer day and I''m lying on my back looking up. I can almost hear the crickets. :)', '2011-04-11 09:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382645, 944783, 15711, '<td valign="top">Amazing, considering it was low 90''s here yesterday. LOL</td>', 'Amazing, considering it was low 90''s here yesterday. LOL', '2011-04-11 09:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382647, 945708, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic sense of it.  Also the use of an almost BW background to the warm amber tones of the syrup/honey. :)</td>', 'I like the graphic sense of it.  Also the use of an almost BW background to the warm amber tones of the syrup/honey. :)', '2011-04-11 09:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382648, 945762, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s like a piece of the clouds fell onto the ground.  This is cool.  Has a hopeful feel.</td>', 'It''s like a piece of the clouds fell onto the ground.  This is cool.  Has a hopeful feel.', '2011-04-11 09:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382649, 945761, 15711, '<td valign="top">HAHA - there are two of these stuck-in-the-sand shots.  I just love his expression of pure bliss.</td>', 'HAHA - there are two of these stuck-in-the-sand shots.  I just love his expression of pure bliss.', '2011-04-11 09:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382650, 945758, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh MY!!  Drop dead gorgeous and my favorite by a mile.  WOW - perfect tones and those eery branches poking up out of the water really add to a mood of mystery and intrigue.  This is stunning.</td>', 'Oh MY!!  Drop dead gorgeous and my favorite by a mile.  WOW - perfect tones and those eery branches poking up out of the water really add to a mood of mystery and intrigue.  This is stunning.', '2011-04-11 09:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382651, 945456, 15711, '<td valign="top">Like a frame from an old movie reel. :)</td>', 'Like a frame from an old movie reel. :)', '2011-04-11 09:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382652, 945766, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t always like foreground bokeh, but knowing that we are peering through the fence just adds to the sense of the baseball game.  Terrific stop action. The red shirts and helmet all tie together nicely against that vivid green background.  This is really good. It''s like a window into early summertime. :) 8</td>', 'I don''t always like foreground bokeh, but knowing that we are peering through the fence just adds to the sense of the baseball game.  Terrific stop action. The red shirts and helmet all tie together nicely against that vivid green background.  This is really good. It''s like a window into early summertime. :) 8', '2011-04-11 09:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6382682, 945682, 124346, '<td valign="top">Nice, so fresh.</td>', 'Nice, so fresh.', '2011-04-11 10:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
