(6382977, 945745, 118396, '<td valign="top">I would have given this image a 10, but to me it doesn''t meet the challenge.  The image is tilted, but I can''t see a horizon (where land transitions to sky).  :(</td>', 'I would have given this image a 10, but to me it doesn''t meet the challenge.  The image is tilted, but I can''t see a horizon (where land transitions to sky).  :(', '2011-04-11 13:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
