(6386278, 945613, 74911, '<td valign="top">Love the use of tilt here. Good use of monochrome. But the crop looks a little tight for my taste. I would leave some room around the model.</td>', 'Love the use of tilt here. Good use of monochrome. But the crop looks a little tight for my taste. I would leave some room around the model.', '2011-04-14 16:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
