(6386502, 945712, 16106, '<td valign="top">Its a nice shot, well framed and edited, but must.....tilt.....more!<br/>The ground may be sliding away but the campanile and the trees say your horizon line is straight. In a challenge like this (or for almost all the others for that matter) it doesn''t pay to be subtle.</td>', 'Its a nice shot, well framed and edited, but must.....tilt.....more!The ground may be sliding away but the campanile and the trees say your horizon line is straight. In a challenge like this (or for almost all the others for that matter) it doesn''t pay to be subtle.', '2011-04-14 20:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
