(6387978, 945666, 130694, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, if only the green foliage blurred in the front wasn''t there I would have given you a 10 (tho I like the green haze across the girls face and the top half of the picture). This picture above all the others made me stop and just look at it for a long time. 9 from me :)</td>', 'I love this picture, if only the green foliage blurred in the front wasn''t there I would have given you a 10 (tho I like the green haze across the girls face and the top half of the picture). This picture above all the others made me stop and just look at it for a long time. 9 from me :)', '2011-04-16 14:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
