(6389172, 945725, 74911, '<td valign="top">Christophe... the title suits best to you more than to the image... you are truly unstoppable... u rock! Huge congrats on the well deserved win! I cannot believe the efforts you put in bringing out what you have in mind... very inspiring, you are... :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-18 07:51:58.</i></td>', 'Christophe... the title suits best to you more than to the image... you are truly unstoppable... u rock! Huge congrats on the well deserved win! I cannot believe the efforts you put in bringing out what you have in mind... very inspiring, you are... :)', '2011-04-18 08:51:48.000000', '2011-04-18 08:51:58.000000', 0),
