(6389180, 945560, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon! The composition works very well. Noise is not very noticeable despite the very high ISO setting, very good work there.</td>', 'Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon! The composition works very well. Noise is not very noticeable despite the very high ISO setting, very good work there.', '2011-04-18 09:04:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6389181, 945758, 114969, '<td valign="top">This is truly an awesome shot, I love the B&amp;W conversion. The sharpness is also admirable. The only thing I don''t like in this photo is the tilt itself: in my opinion, it adds tension and dynamism, but the scene is very calm and peaceful, so it is a bit contradictory. May be just me though. However, congratulations on your well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'This is truly an awesome shot, I love the B&W conversion. The sharpness is also admirable. The only thing I don''t like in this photo is the tilt itself: in my opinion, it adds tension and dynamism, but the scene is very calm and peaceful, so it is a bit contradictory. May be just me though. However, congratulations on your well deserved ribbon!', '2011-04-18 09:09:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6389183, 945757, 44877, '<td valign="top">Good finish, Tony. It''s a great photo - edgy and artsy. The title supports the (dark) whimsy of your work. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Good finish, Tony. It''s a great photo - edgy and artsy. The title supports the (dark) whimsy of your work.  ', '2011-04-18 09:10:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6389184, 945560, 45631, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon! The composition works very well. Noise is not very noticeable despite the very high ISO setting, very good work there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>oops, didn''t realise I had put the incorrect information in for the ISO - will have to correct that.  Thanks Gyaban.                   (16200 ISO now corrected to 200) <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-18 16:37:42.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by gyaban: Congratulations on your well deserved ribbon! The composition works very well. Noise is not very noticeable despite the very high ISO setting, very good work there.   oops, didn''t realise I had put the incorrect information in for the ISO - will have to correct that.  Thanks Gyaban.                   (16200 ISO now corrected to 200) ', '2011-04-18 09:15:21.000000', '2011-04-18 17:37:42.000000', 0),
