(6389361, 944864, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely processing, Richard, as well as great scenery. I lived in Calgary back in the 1970s and was fascinated by the Chinook winds, with the prominent arch of stratus clouds and the sudden rise in temperatures we would get for a day or two.</td>', 'Lovely processing, Richard, as well as great scenery. I lived in Calgary back in the 1970s and was fascinated by the Chinook winds, with the prominent arch of stratus clouds and the sudden rise in temperatures we would get for a day or two.', '2011-04-18 11:26:48.000000', NULL, 0),
