(6391450, 945725, 103142, '<td valign="top">Finally getting around to congratulating people -- I was out of town for a week, and just dabbling here and there.<br/> <br/>Awesome shot! Incredibly well done! You must not have buried yourself too deep. I tried burying my husband<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=915418" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1284/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_915418.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1284/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_915418.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1284/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_915418.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>but the problem was I put too much sand on him, and he found it difficult to breathe! I was so nervous, I forgot to change angles and experiment with the shot. :)<br/> <br/>Great idea, wonderful -- as always!! Huge congrats!</td>', 'Finally getting around to congratulating people -- I was out of town for a week, and just dabbling here and there. Awesome shot! Incredibly well done! You must not have buried yourself too deep. I tried burying my husband   but the problem was I put too much sand on him, and he found it difficult to breathe! I was so nervous, I forgot to change angles and experiment with the shot. :) Great idea, wonderful -- as always!! Huge congrats!', '2011-04-20 14:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
